WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.201
- IT TURNS OUT
IT WASN'T A GHOST AT ALL.

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:05.138
IT WAS MY LITTLE SISTER HIDING
IN THE BASEMENT!

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:08.775
AND SHE WAS GOIN' "BOO"
AND MAKING THE NOISES

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.543
THE WHOLE TIME, SO...

00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:20.987
- OH, SHOOT.
I FORGOT HIS JUICE BOXES.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.156
- OH.
- I WILL BE RIGHT BACK.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.157
YOU'LL BE ALL RIGHT
WITH ZACHARY?

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:28.861
- I THINK SO.
- OKAY.

00:00:28.894 --> 00:00:33.733
- SO, ZACHARY...

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:36.702
YOU KNOW I'M, UH, GONNA BE
MARRYING YOU MOTHER

00:00:36.735 --> 00:00:39.272
AND, UH,
I'M GONNA BE MOVING IN SOON

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:41.741
AND I JUST...

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:45.979
I'M SO EXCITED
TO SPEND MORE TIME WITH YOU.

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:52.718
YOU KNOW,
I KNOW THAT YOU HAD A HARD TIME

00:00:52.751 --> 00:00:58.424
WITH YOUR FATHER AND HE SPANKED
YOU AND, YOU KNOW,

00:00:58.457 --> 00:01:03.596
I JUST WANT YOU TO KNOW
THAT'S NOT GONNA HAPPEN WITH ME.

00:01:03.629 --> 00:01:04.630
OKAY?

00:01:04.663 --> 00:01:09.836
AND I PROMISE I
WILL NEVER SPANK YOU.

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:15.675 line:92%
OKAY. THAT'S... OKAY.

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:19.011
UM...

00:01:19.044 --> 00:01:21.681
I KNOW WHY YOU DID THAT.

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:27.253
BUT I WILL NEVER SPANK YOU
BECAUSE I KNOW THAT YOU STILL--

00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:31.891
OH! THAT'S--

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:34.327
OW.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:35.728
I DON'T KNOW
THAT THERE'S ANYTHING

00:01:35.761 --> 00:01:39.065
I DID TO DESERVE THAT--OKAY.

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:44.971
THIS...YOU...OKAY.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:48.007
MM. I'MA BE REAL WITH YOU.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.143
YOU CAN'T GO HITTIN' PEOPLE.

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:52.011
ALL RI--OH! OH! OH!

00:01:52.044 --> 00:01:55.682
I AIN'T COMING BACK
FOR THAT FOURTH ONE.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:59.418
ALL RIGHT. SO WE DONE?

00:01:59.451 --> 00:02:01.120
WE GOT THAT OUT OF OUR SYSTEM?

00:02:01.153 --> 00:02:04.957
'CAUSE I KNOW THAT THIS...

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:07.860
THIS ISN'T YOU.
OH!

00:02:07.893 --> 00:02:12.064
I TOLD YOU--UH! OH! OH! COME ON!

00:02:12.097 --> 00:02:15.067
THIS...OH! OH! OH!

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:17.436
THIS...YOU...
UGH! UGH! WHY!

00:02:17.469 --> 00:02:18.738
- FAST.
- OH WHAT?

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:20.306
OOH! UGH! OH!

00:02:20.339 --> 00:02:22.742
THAT'S UNBELIEVABLE.

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:25.845
WHY--WHAT DID I DO?

00:02:25.878 --> 00:02:27.213
I'M THE GOOD GUY.

00:02:27.246 --> 00:02:31.050
I'M--I'M THE GOOD GUY, MAN.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:36.923
LOOK.

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:39.458
I'M NEVER GONNA SPANK YOU.

00:02:39.491 --> 00:02:43.129
I'M NOT GONNA BE
LIKE YOUR FATHER.

00:02:43.162 --> 00:02:44.330
I'M GONNA BE YOUR FRIEND.

00:02:49.535 --> 00:02:51.370
YOU NEED TO RESPECT ME!

00:02:51.403 --> 00:02:55.275
YOU UNDERSTAND?
YOU LITTLE [bleep]!

00:03:10.856 --> 00:03:14.994
- I WILL RESPECT YOU, CHARLES.

00:03:15.027 --> 00:03:17.363
IF YOU PLAY YOUR ROLE.

00:03:17.396 --> 00:03:19.966
NOW, LISTEN UP...

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:24.270
I'M A BAD, BAD BOY, CHARLES.

00:03:24.303 --> 00:03:28.174
I DON'T NEED A [bleep] FRIEND.

00:03:28.207 --> 00:03:30.142
SO GO AHEAD.
MARRY MY MOMMY.

00:03:30.175 --> 00:03:31.477
MOVE IN.

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.813 line:92%
[bleep] HER AS HARD AS YOU WANT.

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:37.883
JUST LEAVE ME
THE [bleep] ALONE.

00:03:37.916 --> 00:03:43.055
YOU DO THAT, 11 YEARS FROM NOW,
I'LL BE OUT OF THE HOUSE

00:03:43.088 --> 00:03:46.659
AND WE WON'T HAVE ANY PROBLEMS.

00:03:46.692 --> 00:03:49.061
YOU DON'T...

00:03:49.094 --> 00:03:55.067
AND I WILL BREAK YOU.

00:03:55.100 --> 00:04:00.973
OKAY, CHARLES?

00:04:01.006 --> 00:04:02.375
- HOW ARE WE DOING?

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:03.408
- I LOVE HIM!

